{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14105481","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14105481","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1410548101:1":{"text":"我的幻影花，在慢慢长大呢……谁能想到地表的阳光是如此温暖……","source_cn":"我的幻影花，在慢慢长大呢……谁能想到地表的阳光是如此温暖……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87B32B45D5978F82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410548102:1":{"text":"虽然很不想相信，但他们好像真的说了谎。地表根本不是女王说的那样。","source_cn":"虽然很不想相信，但他们好像真的说了谎。地表根本不是女王...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0EA361652045D03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410548103:1":{"text":"但恩典灵露和龙……我还是得问问才能死心。女王不会那么残忍吧……","source_cn":"但恩典灵露和龙……我还是得问问才能死心。女王不会那么残...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F31C61B378F860B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410548104:1":{"text":"看来咱们都有必须返回地底的理由。","source_cn":"看来咱们都有必须返回地底的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA967AF9023406CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410548104":{"text":"看来咱们都有必须返回地底的理由。","source_cn":"看来咱们都有必须返回地底的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA967AF9023406CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen